OL,3,GNEWSACouncil labels derelict NHS
OL,4,Abuilding 'dangerous'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA derelict building owned by the NHS
OL,7,Fwhich is being used by so-called urban
OL,8,Fexplorers is dangerous and needs to be
OL,9,Fmade more secure, a council has said.
OL,11,FFulwood House, a 1960s tower block on
OL,12,FOld Fulwood Road in Sheffield,
OL,13,Fpreviously housed NHS administration
OL,14,Fstaff but has been empty since 2018.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
