OL,3,GNEWSACouncil labels derelict NHS
OL,4,Abuilding 'dangerous'
OL,5,
OL,6,FEarlier this year, Sheffield Council
OL,7,Fapproved plans for it to be developed
OL,8,Ffor housing and despite security
OL,9,Ffences, the council said it had
OL,10,Fidentified "several weaknesses" in the
OL,11,Fperimeter cordon of the building which
OL,12,Fhas now been registered as a dangerous
OL,13,Fstructure.
OL,15,FThe NHS confirmed that whilst measures
OL,16,Fwere in place including 24/7 security,
OL,17,Fthey will now take "further action"
OL,18,Ffollowing a "thorough investigation".
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
